*Heading
** FIELD-VARIABLE PROBE for vumat_grind.for
** Eight C3D8R cubes of 0.0003 mm, one per injected chip thickness.
** Material card copied verbatim from multi_abrasive_field.inp
** material: sandstone     dc = 8.775000e-05 mm (87.7500 nm)
**
** WHAT THIS ANSWERS
**   SDV14 must come back as the h injected into each element.
**   SDV13 must be 1 (ductile) where h < dc and 2 (brittle) above.
**   If every SDV14 is zero, field variable 1 is NOT reaching the
**   VUMAT, and every field-carrying deck in this project is
**   running 100%% ductile while looking entirely healthy.
